# Supabase functions — required secrets (set in project Settings → Edge Functions,
# or `supabase secrets set NAME=value`):
#
#   SUPABASE_URL                e.g. https://xyzcompany.supabase.co
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY   service_role key (server-side only, never in the app)
#   CREDENTIALS_KEY             >=16 chars, used to AES-GCM encrypt Daraja secrets at rest
#
# The mpesa-callback CallBackURL is derived at runtime as
#   ${SUPABASE_URL}/functions/v1/mpesa-callback
